{"title":"One Root Equations Document","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Deriving_the_quadratic_formula\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Deriving the quadratic formula</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#The_discriminant_when_a=_c\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The discriminant when a= c</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Example_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Example 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Example_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Example 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#The_discriminant_when_a=b\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The discriminant when a=b</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Example_1_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Example 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Example_2_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Example 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#The_discriminant_when_b=c\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The discriminant when b=c</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Example_1_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Example 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Example_2_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Example 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Conclusion\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Conclusion</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Deriving_the_quadratic_formula\">Deriving the quadratic formula</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=One_Root_Equations_Document&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Deriving the quadratic formula\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When we have a quadratic, we normally specify it in the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/1/98172d1b54b563033d26dc22c407dad4d4802be5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax^2+bx+c=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"130\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>The way to find a formula for the roots of the equations goes as follows:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/06164804567110ae13aa984d701c0fa79adbc9f8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[ax^2+bx+c=0\\]\" width=\"130\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/5/9c54c07b45125a31c0d3146d00fd594073082d88.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{ax^2+bx+c}{a}=\\frac{0}{a}\\]\" width=\"136\" height=\"38\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/c/5dc3bae5faeec163b06295ede59708e94b08e26b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2+\\frac{bx}{a}+\\frac{c}{a}=0\\]\" width=\"130\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/0/d101677f3dc74e9086e92bcfbb6983736de32ef9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{We complete the square to get}\\]\" width=\"222\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/f/2af3e42ee6c5f75ff99ca68edb115518015a1dca.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x+\\frac{b}{2a})^2+\\frac{c}{a}=\\frac{b^2}{4a^2}\\]\" width=\"164\" height=\"39\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/1/b01c9b536d4453b6a5394c620a40a54101ef33a8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x+\\frac{b}{2a})^2=\\frac{b^2}{4a^2}-\\frac{c}{a}\\]\" width=\"164\" height=\"39\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/3/393b65c7939ff3013ab911007eab456e98251517.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x+\\frac{b}{2a})^2=\\frac{b^2}{4a^2}-\\frac{c}{a}*\\frac{4a}{4a}\\]\" width=\"203\" height=\"39\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/b/8fb6901a657651ae83634f3ea0a8f24aa66f20be.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x+\\frac{b}{2a})^2=\\frac{b^2-4ac}{4a^2}\\]\" width=\"166\" height=\"39\" />\n</p>\n<pre style=\"color:red\">\\[\\sqrt{(x+\\frac{b}{2a})^2=\\frac{b^2-4ac}{4a^2}\\] (Error compiling LaTeX. Unknown error_msg)</pre>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/9/ae9d16013f99fbbf6009a9bba309724e59c01c90.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x+\\frac{b}{2a}=\\pm \\frac{\\sqrt{b^2-4ac}}{2a}\\]\" width=\"175\" height=\"40\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/9/ae9fbaca8006b44a05852bef96e1f54ef49bc27b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x+\\frac{b}{2a}-\\frac{b}{2a}=\\pm \\frac{\\sqrt{b^2-4ac}}{2a}-\\frac{b}{2a}\\]\" width=\"264\" height=\"40\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/5/9f546e5f5bff2c8fbf7729d8a4669689c00a6ffa.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x=\\frac{-b \\pm \\sqrt{b^2-4ac}}{2a}\\]\" width=\"160\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>We have two real roots when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/d/cdde304880a351ef3c38737d3856b59b31373eeb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{b^2-4ac}&gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"112\" height=\"18\" /> \nWe have complex roots when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/e/5cefd848be8dff1ae0c7e0794c2aa550cd6c08c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{b^2-4ac}&lt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"112\" height=\"18\" />\nWe have one root when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/9/399497a6c27823e500297c99a1dc716a3aaae738.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{b^2-4ac}=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"112\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>We are going to analyze the case when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/9/399497a6c27823e500297c99a1dc716a3aaae738.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{b^2-4ac}=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"112\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/8/b583c5da82fc9dfee108cfc8bd890a63051a9dbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^2-4ac$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"64\" height=\"15\" /> is called the <b>discriminant.</b>\n</p><p>Square both sides to get:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/f/b6fcce7eab90d0f2b69f98762c27022e5618fa1b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^2-4ac=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"97\" height=\"15\" />\nAdd <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/7/5d73681283b9416cebf70590fdce2bb581c95335.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4ac$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> to both sides to get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/f/71f776091da02aa8d3c44dbd0d8d7e6129a134ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^2=4ac$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"66\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><br />\nLet’s evaluate cases now.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"The_discriminant_when_a.3D_c\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_discriminant_when_a=_c\">The discriminant when a= c</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=One_Root_Equations_Document&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: The discriminant when a= c\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First we evaluate the case <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/1/f717c40ef1d78faf6efbaef5c9e6f804d544faf3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=c$\" width=\"42\" height=\"8\" />\n</p><p>When a=c, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/5/b6583bce5bee7344b9b33984c8ffb5f3888e6a60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^2=4a^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"64\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/f/d4f37679e264bdff29201b88f1cd01ed1b16ef4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^2=4c^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"62\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Take the square root of both sides to get:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/d/55d51a8ec5e1d36c50a5825ff2bf29acd4be7495.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=2c$\" width=\"49\" height=\"12\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/8/a0874c15e47cf556c14c7f59e27992d91c3aacec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=2a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Therefore when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/1/f717c40ef1d78faf6efbaef5c9e6f804d544faf3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=c$\" width=\"42\" height=\"8\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/8/a0874c15e47cf556c14c7f59e27992d91c3aacec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=2a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" /> we are going to have one root for the equation.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Example_1\">Example 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=One_Root_Equations_Document&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Example 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/0/4d0da309d7a0eeaae252772cd5ca2dd41e5bf0d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9x^2+18x+9x=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"152\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc573b04a4af4279880a3662818ce8c3cd2fbdc4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-18 \\pm \\sqrt{(18)^2-4*9*9}}{2*9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"198\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/4/f6470d3c8f25ab3c77c65cedb65f2ec3c3932251.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-18 \\pm \\sqrt{(9^2*2^2)-(9^2*2^2)}}{2*9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"226\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/9/6096282e465ace4f859d47520d9fac8e838ea992.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-18 \\pm \\sqrt{0}}{18}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"81\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/4/2746ccebea55ac1c1a5848ea34b70af6fee84902.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-18}{18}=\\boxed{-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"95\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Example_2\">Example 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=One_Root_Equations_Document&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Example 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/a/1ca23d4cda120a62f86dd3b5061cfc0b1786051f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+2x+1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"123\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/a/b2a647896da5995368d3bb214e255c5ff11c3e38.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-2 \\pm \\sqrt{2^2-4*1*1}}{2*1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"163\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/c/cec8458f9a76b1bd45a38f0f89c59b1e30b442e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-2 \\pm \\sqrt{4-4}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"103\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/6/5265ae0dee51e40ed6d3a40d528290e5872b48f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-2 \\pm \\sqrt{0}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"72\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/c/3dc145267f950b79399cd210120880b082481062.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-2}{2}=\\boxed{-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"86\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/1/f717c40ef1d78faf6efbaef5c9e6f804d544faf3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=c$\" width=\"42\" height=\"8\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/8/a0874c15e47cf556c14c7f59e27992d91c3aacec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=2a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" /> we can write the problem as follows:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/3/fc36d3faa1cffd1f091dbbf91bf6174464c542ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax^2+2ax+a=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"143\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Using the quadratic formula, we get:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/5/485f9e51a62a1d0d78e1a20b2912027a5a913b21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-2a \\pm \\sqrt{(2a)^2-4*a*a}}{2*a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"200\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/c/22cec1c8bba0cbc83d14302a9b6a7546a6065fa6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-2a \\pm \\sqrt{4a^2-4a^2}}{2a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"147\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/4/7748e655f42ba68a2c69e05bfdaf3b5c11dbd69e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-2a \\pm \\sqrt{0}}{2a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"81\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/d/e7df799280b4416e1b73396d61a7ca35c28e34c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-2a}{2a}=\\boxed{-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"96\" height=\"37\" /> \n</p><p>A simpler way to do this, is to start off by dividing by a.  We get:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/a/1ca23d4cda120a62f86dd3b5061cfc0b1786051f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+2x+1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"123\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/f/0ff8c977e83b2c430b8b6aad29d242e63a7dcdf8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+1)^2=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/e/75e0ded1b9ecf9a8ef626533f8a4740913c19363.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\boxed{-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"69\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p>If we want to write this as one equality, we can do as follows:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/1/f717c40ef1d78faf6efbaef5c9e6f804d544faf3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=c$\" width=\"42\" height=\"8\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/8/a0874c15e47cf556c14c7f59e27992d91c3aacec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=2a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Divide by 2 on the second equation to get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/6/706b43d2f0fbb34dfe8228b285a35a313598d564.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{b}{2}=a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"47\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Therefore we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/3/de3199c68c0290dbe14e17a343b9767303cdb34d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=c=\\frac{b}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"77\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><b>So, when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/3/de3199c68c0290dbe14e17a343b9767303cdb34d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=c=\\frac{b}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"77\" height=\"37\" /> we will have one root, and that one root will be –1.</b>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"The_discriminant_when_a.3Db\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_discriminant_when_a=b\">The discriminant when a=b</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=One_Root_Equations_Document&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: The discriminant when a=b\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/b/5abd2c942ae299fd26e18d0ca5d390a7ca4a8c34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=b$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" /> we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/f/b6fcce7eab90d0f2b69f98762c27022e5618fa1b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^2-4ac=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"97\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/c/70caf110f1f4f5fbc870c1eca50fd3b1d74dcdfe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2-4ac=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"98\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/9/ae92575fd66398db6b21029c7cfddf7d03977c10.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(a-4c)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"108\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>The roots are going to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/1/f41f56af994d4ba7ea63873c46b74d6c261eee6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=0, a=4c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"102\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Therefore we have:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/6/1660d43b4960efd50409826b189fce815544ca22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=b=0$\" width=\"74\" height=\"12\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/f/20fade8584d25bfe33213743b57db475ea4f9689.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=b=4c$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"83\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>However, if (a,b)=0, we would be left with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/7/32733cebc2e7565fad24d0a7ba52e70a714b2315.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0*x^2+0x+c)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"163\" height=\"19\" />\nThis is only a constant term left.\n</p><p>So, our only case is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/f/20fade8584d25bfe33213743b57db475ea4f9689.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=b=4c$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"83\" height=\"13\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Example_1_2\">Example 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=One_Root_Equations_Document&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Example 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/0/bf027445694ec1df5653a7ff614928db676abc92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^2+4x+1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"132\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/3/ac31dbb667ed4c1f38092905af4e8a9bb07d2315.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-4 \\pm \\sqrt{4^2-4*4*1}}{2*4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"167\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/b/9fb23fac1e842525fa7cf22d69b108b74abcfd2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-4 \\pm \\sqrt{16-16}}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"121\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/b/51bb775601b768d972808e97eedf07b4ae81072d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-4}{8}=\\boxed{\\frac{-1}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"90\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Example_2_2\">Example 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=One_Root_Equations_Document&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Example 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/5/3d56a7b8a27b61519c22d08df3e086da5ffa29ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8x^2+8x+2=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"132\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/5/2956d735c20dbd0a4d24c66b48d1ccf8878c5c28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-8 \\pm \\sqrt{8^2-4*8*2}}{2*8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"163\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/2/9c27ffe8717cb09d7e9b5267c0f157e1846f19ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-8 \\pm \\sqrt{64-64}}{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"121\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/3/85369eb79de7bb7332b8f6fed6776beebe3a5de7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-8}{16}=\\boxed{\\frac{-1}2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"90\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p>Let’s find a general formula for this.\nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/f/20fade8584d25bfe33213743b57db475ea4f9689.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=b=4c$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"83\" height=\"13\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/8/7f81fa89bc20b6b263f0f66aeffb2a5a6af9340e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4cx^2+4cx+c=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"147\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Using the quadratic formula, we get:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/6/b265ef3e412838e1de74e2dd8fae1a13a390f224.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-4c \\pm \\sqrt{4c^2-4*4c*c}}{2*4c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"185\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/c/59caa853cdc87eb8613ce1fe0cefa00c21b35b41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-4c \\pm \\sqrt{4c^2-4c^2}}{8c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"142\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/c/7ccd96e1c56afd8ff7562e5d34fd97e41dc378fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-4c \\pm 0}{8c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"64\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/3/1539a9554348a091c678848b2150ebfff1480e3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-4c}{8c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"33\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/a/56a80e76cad62711a2f3cc8e938649c651cf744a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-4*\\cancel{c}}{8*\\cancel{c}}=\\boxed{\\frac{-1}2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"115\" height=\"48\" />  \n</p><p>Another way to do this, is to start off by dividing by c.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/0/bf027445694ec1df5653a7ff614928db676abc92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^2+4x+1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"132\" height=\"16\" />\nDivide by 4 to get:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/6/59667dead1ffd2f8bcec4cd0a75a68fabe717c4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+x+\\frac{1}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"84\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/e/84e36c3d37c9fbae4930ad040131842eb58d9c6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+\\frac{1}{2})^2=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"102\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/4/704c80743ae771151801b1d14c074846600b3a44.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\boxed{\\frac{-1}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"73\" height=\"48\" /> \n</p><p><b>Therefore when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/f/20fade8584d25bfe33213743b57db475ea4f9689.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=b=4c$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"83\" height=\"13\" /> we will have one root which will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/5/c853bfb15f8cf5a622c714ab9586566175ef5a90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"25\" height=\"37\" /></b>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"The_discriminant_when_b.3Dc\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_discriminant_when_b=c\">The discriminant when b=c</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=One_Root_Equations_Document&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: The discriminant when b=c\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/f/b6fcce7eab90d0f2b69f98762c27022e5618fa1b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^2-4ac=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"97\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/d/ebda5306c70a24c574ef0107ed5b5152b5f594cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=c$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />, therefore\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/9/609e289cfb19bd51f8b01d702a78b9345d8f565a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c^2-4ac=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"97\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/e/c4e01384fd780a04b88f7e9d6afeb2b8dfde6514.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c(c-4a)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"103\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>The roots are going to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/0/a80d7a3ca845e6cae14b9db710b64331219ec3f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" /> which gives us:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/8/3a8dd51607cb767116349564f09149ddf922df80.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0(0-4a)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"106\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/d/ebda5306c70a24c574ef0107ed5b5152b5f594cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=c$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/4/8c4c04e0a5eb33118444904011c6c89276bc91e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax^2+0*x+0=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"150\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/0/600e562b0d7da8597327b7fbd6dae634ae598eb6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax^2=0$\" width=\"60\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Divide by a to get:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/986b009b4f234009b2950936fc960778a9deec86.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2=0$\" width=\"50\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/e/34ea5b6f6de584d56d19a89cc4923a9d9a5cfa41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=0$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>However, since (a,b,x)=(0,0,0) this is just a case with only a quadratic term, and shouldn’t be considered.\n</p><p>Let’s try the second case of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/5/835d7c43f3d0ec3ec11e1f4e67a0b7d0b4d860f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c(c-4a)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"69\" height=\"18\" /> which is going to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/0/c30a5bb6c85758beeec3a15da4b8e618d0f2c44f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=4a$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"50\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>We have:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/a/e1aee5924851b9fa1ec7bf6223c2636f103e0a7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=c=4a$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Example_1_3\">Example 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=One_Root_Equations_Document&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Example 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/a/00afa1d026972169592b7ec9fba8371226ee4eb0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+4x+4=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"123\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/b/8cb8d5b964cd962a17c4bd54c8489adfbe4773a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+2)^2=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/2/f226eebf91a88812cbbed46cd0a97e67530a7494.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-2$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Example_2_3\">Example 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=One_Root_Equations_Document&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Example 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/a/eea2d3c56372b3a64f0955927ab2106157563c85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x^2+8x+8=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"132\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/8/5f8032450c3f413ef386b866f8d38964ad4f7a6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-8 \\pm \\sqrt{8^2-4*8*2}}{2*2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"163\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/1/2c15625f0f6f407114b87e7c6053171af2c17f47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-8 \\pm 0}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"57\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/3/26351773d0b99984dd05da31cf2caa3182eaf0c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-8}{4}=-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"74\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Let’s try an in-general example of when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/a/e1aee5924851b9fa1ec7bf6223c2636f103e0a7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=c=4a$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/9/ba9c0ffd62044f5feae75c437d22eee65195ebd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax^2+4ax+4a=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"152\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Using the quadratic formula, we get \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/c/c0c30335305f297fc46ef826464687213e08f3ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{-4a \\pm \\sqrt{(4a)^2-4*4a*a}}{2*a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"244\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/a/19a755651116f7794e12d0ab9f40444d30bae1e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{-4a \\pm \\sqrt{16a^2-16a^2}}{2a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"200\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/f/58f063d5e28fe4abd2d61fb5a71c8b89e21ca80c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{-4a}{2a}=-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"118\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>We can also start off by dividing by a to get:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/a/00afa1d026972169592b7ec9fba8371226ee4eb0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+4x+4=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"123\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/b/8cb8d5b964cd962a17c4bd54c8489adfbe4773a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+2)^2=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/3/693dc89db740cb8d63e38b3e4cd15496f9cfcef1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\boxed{-2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"69\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p><b>Therefore when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/a/e1aee5924851b9fa1ec7bf6223c2636f103e0a7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=c=4a$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" /> in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/1/98172d1b54b563033d26dc22c407dad4d4802be5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax^2+bx+c=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"130\" height=\"16\" />, the root is going to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/a/62a76677add1d246708c86edfc7c4b8a40184914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /></b>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conclusion\">Conclusion</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=One_Root_Equations_Document&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Conclusion\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/0/e801a3eb5fa703d7d4f173fd0298e82789acf80c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=\\frac{b}{2}=c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"79\" height=\"37\" /> we will have one root.  That one root will be –1.\n</p><p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/f/20fade8584d25bfe33213743b57db475ea4f9689.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=b=4c$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"83\" height=\"13\" /> we will have one root.  That one root will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/5/c853bfb15f8cf5a622c714ab9586566175ef5a90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"25\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/5/b45d7e6f98a83d4ad3fd18a69eb3ec30c6d232b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4a=b=c$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"83\" height=\"13\" /> we will have one root.  That one root will be –2.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017155143\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.060 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.590 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 619/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 21703/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:9392:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017155143 and revision id 38975. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}